      "role": "user",
      "content": "My bad, i forgot i hadn't attached the text yet. Here is the exact wording of Section 4.2: \n\n\"4.2 Price Adjustments: The Supplier reserves the right to implement a price increase of up to 5% during peak demand months (June-August) without prior written notice to SwiftRoute, provided such increases are aligned with market indices.\"\n\nSo, like i asked, does this give them the right to change rates unexpectedly? I really need to be sure before I sign off on this.",
